Question: Determine whether the following two code snippets are semantic code clones.

Code 1: Python
```python
def sum_even_numbers(numbers):
    total = 0
    for n in numbers:
        if n % 2 == 0:
            total += n
    return total
```

Code 2: Java
```java
public static int countVowels(String text) {
    int count = 0;
    int i = 0;

    while (i < text.length()) {
        char c = Character.toLowerCase(text.charAt(i));
        if (c == 'a' || c == 'e' || c == 'i' || c == 'o' || c == 'u') {
            count++;
        }
        i++;
    }

    return count;
}
```
